  4.3 Proprietary Modifications

  The Licensee may develop and retain proprietary modifications
to the Software. The Licensee is not required by this license to
make those modifications available under TWEPL or any other 
open-source license.

  4.4 No Obligation to Contribute

  The Licensee is not required to submit modifications, bug fixes,
improvements, or other contributions to the original TimWorks Engine
project or its Copyright Holder.

  4.5 Obligations Upon Distribution

  The permissions in this section do not exempt the Licensee from the
attribution, modification-disclosure, copyright-notice, or other
requirements that apply when distributing the Software or a 
Modified Version under this license.

