4. Respect applicable third-party license requirements.

  5.5 No Mandatory Public Release

  Nothing in this license requires the Licensee to publish a Fork, disclose
proprietary modifications, make a public repository, or contribute changes to
the original project.
  This provision does not remove the attribution and modification-disclosure
obligations expressly imposed by Section 2.

  5.6 Independent Licensing of Modifications

  The Licensee may distribute their original modifications under separate
licensing terms, including proprietary terms, provided that the Licensee has
