applicable copyright and license notices in accompanying documentation
or other materials reasonably accessible to recipients.

  6.4 No False Claims of Authorship

  The Licensee must not falsely claim to have authored material 
created by the original Copyright Holder or another contributor.
  This section does not prevent the Licensee from accurately
identifying their own contributions or describing their Fork as
an independently developed project.

